# Species tab in the character creator.
wf-creator-species-tab = Species
wf-creator-species-heading = Pick a species

# One line per species, key facts only. Everything here is drawn from the species' own damage
# modifiers, organs and components, so keep it in step with those if they change.
species-summary-human = The baseline. No resistances, no weaknesses.
species-summary-arachnid = Spins websilk and crafts with it. Two extra pockets. Suffocates faster.
species-summary-avali = Ammonia raptor. Shrugs off cold, burns fast. Meat only, and eats double.
species-summary-canine = Vulpkanin build, but you pick the muzzle. Sharp nose, dog colour vision.
species-summary-chitinid = Chitin shell. Shrugs off radiation, hates cold. Needles will not go through.
species-summary-diona = Plant. Tough against blows, catches fire easily. No shoes. Splits into nymphs.
species-summary-dwarf = Sees ore through rock. Human durability otherwise.
species-summary-felionoid = Silent on bare paws. Human durability.
species-summary-feroxi = Tough build, cuts hurt more. Dries out fast, so keep drinking.
species-summary-goblin = Small and poison hardy. Rummages bins. Sets off every mousetrap.
species-summary-harpy = Sings. Flies where there is altitude. Takes more brute.
species-summary-hydrakin = Iceworld bird. Immune to cold, hates heat. Cannot wear glasses.
species-summary-ipc = Machine. No air, no food, runs on a power cell. Shock does double.
species-summary-moth = Eats cloth, not food. Flies. Burns easily.
species-summary-oni = Hits hard in melee, poor with guns. Takes less brute.
species-summary-reptilian = Cold blooded. Handles heat, suffers in cold. Claws.
species-summary-resomi = Tiny and fragile. Built for deep cold, overheats easily. Fits in a duffelbag.
species-summary-rodentia = Small and squishy. Crawls under tables. Sets off every mousetrap.
species-summary-shadekin = Does not breathe. Stronger in the dark, bleeds badly. Claws.
species-summary-skrell = Handles heat and cold. Brittle under blows. Drinks twice as much.
species-summary-slimeperson = Squishy. Shrugs off blows, splits under blades. Hates cold. Holds items inside.
species-summary-synth = Android. No air or food, runs on a battery. Shock hurts. No cloning.
species-summary-tajaran = Furred and built for cold. Fragile. Silent on bare paws.
species-summary-thaven = Bound by Moods you have to play out. Their hits drain stamina.
species-summary-vox = Breathes nitrogen. Oxygen is poison. Lives on internals.
species-summary-vulpkanin = Sharp nose, dog colour vision. Burns a little easier.

# Protogen chassis. All of them take extra shock.
species-summary-protogen = The standard chassis. Armoured against blows, but shock and radiation bite.
species-summary-protoarachnid = Arachnid frame. Armoured, but shock and radiation hurt. Ignores webs.
species-summary-protoavali = Avali frame. Shrugs off cold, burns fast. Can shell up to heal.
species-summary-protodawi = Dwarf frame. Armoured, but shock and radiation hurt.
species-summary-protodionae = Plant frame. Tough against blows, catches fire easily. Splits into nymphs.
species-summary-protofeline = Feline frame. Good in cold, weak to heat and shock.
species-summary-protohumie = Closest to a plain protogen chassis. Mild cold resistance.
species-summary-protokin = Shadekin frame. Does not breathe. Bleeds badly, repairs with tools.
species-summary-protomoth = Moth frame. Good in cold, burns faster.
species-summary-protoreptile = Reptile frame. Takes heat well, suffers in cold.
species-summary-protoresomi = Small resomi frame. Built for cold, overheats. Can jump gaps.
species-summary-protoslimeperson = Slime frame. Shrugs off blows, splits under blades. Cold is dangerous.
species-summary-protothaven = Bound by Moods you have to play out. Their hits drain stamina.
species-summary-protovox = Vox frame without the nitrogen problem. Good in cold, weak to heat and shock.
species-summary-protovulp = Vulp frame. Good in cold, weak to heat and shock. Can jump gaps.
